# The portable suite on the js target. Run from the repository root.
#
#   haxe test/js/build.hxml
#
# No runtime here (node is not installed), so this is a generation check.
# That still earns its place: the failure it catches is a generator-stage one that `--no-output`
# does not see.
-cp src
-cp test/common
-cp test/common/fixtures
-cp test/lib
# The library ships with this applied via extraParams.hxml (`-lib hxscript`). The suite uses
# `-cp src`, which does not read extraParams, so without this line the suite tests a
# configuration no consumer builds: under the default -dce std the standard-library members a
# script reaches by reflection are stripped, and EReg loses its methods.
--macro hxscript.macro.Keep.run()

-main AllCommon
-js bin_test/js/all.js
